  The xsmart_spawn module, faction questions renamed, and xtrade moved to AlifePlus
    The new xsmart_spawn module holds the smart spawn injectors that xsmart carried, and xtrade leaves xlibs for AlifePlus.
    In xsmart the faction questions take names that say what they ask, with a three-state hostility check and curated trader factions in xdata.
