    - Added get_npc_effective_faction, an NPC's faction with the xdata override first, and assign_squad_to_smart, the SIMBOARD assign as a call.
    - Changed get_smart_faction to the name get_controlling_faction. It reads the smart's holder, and an unheld smart reads "none".
    - Changed get_smart_factions to the name get_declared_factions, and find_smarts_with_recipe to the name find_smarts_spawning.
    - Changed is_smart_empty to take the smart id.
    - Changed find_smart and find_first_smart to match factions through accepts_faction. A smart that declares all_stalker or all_monster now matches.
    - Removed accepts_mutant, has_faction, has_factions, has_capacity and get_trader_at_smart.
    - Changed set_shared_spawn, set_exclusive_spawn, clear_shared_spawn, clear_exclusive_spawn, reset_spawns, repopulate and SQUADS_BY_SPECIES to move into xsmart_spawn.

  xsmart_spawn
    - Added xsmart_spawn, the spawn injectors moved out of xsmart, with SQUADS_BY_FACTION beside SQUADS_BY_SPECIES.

  xtrade
    - Removed xtrade. Its trade code lives in AlifePlus as ap_ext_trade.

  xdata
    - Changed npc_roles to carry a faction on every curated service NPC. Traders who serve everyone get their faction from the lore, such as Petrenko with Duty and Sakharov at Yantar.

