  xsmart
    - Added has_surge_shelter.
    - Changed has_capacity to count squads still on their way.

  xstash
    - Added get_stash_items, a stash's contents read without looting it.

  xtime
    - Added xtime with game_sec, the game seconds since the epoch.

  xlibs
    - Added is_compatible, the same major at or above the required version.

1.2.1
  The xconst sentinels, the MCM config helper and a token bucket peek
    The new xconst module holds the X-Ray sentinel values, and xmcm builds a mod's MCM config.

  - Added xconst with INVALID_ENTITY_ID and INVALID_LEVEL_VERTEX_ID.
  - Added create_config in xmcm, and the Russian strings of the xlibs MCM page.
  - Added peek to the token bucket, a check that takes no token.
  - Fixed the Dead City barman missing from xdata.unscriptable_npcs.

1.2.0
  The token bucket, smart squads and smart property reads
    The xttltable module adds a token bucket, and xsmart reads a smart's squads, anomalies, campfires and trader and mechanic jobs.

  - Added create_token_bucket in xttltable, a rate limiter per key.
  - Added get_smart_squads, has_anomaly, has_campfire, has_trader_job and has_mechanic_job in xsmart.
  - Added sweep in xtable.

1.0.5
  Level presence guards in xlevel
    The xlevel calls check for a present level.

  - Fixed get_game_hours and get_current_level_name calling the level with no level present.

1.0.4
  The unscriptable rename and the task giver check
    The protected names become unscriptable, and xcreature checks a task giver.

  - Changed is_protected to the name is_unscriptable in xcreature, is_protected_squad to is_unscriptable_squad in xsquad, and xdata.protected_npcs to unscriptable_npcs.
  - Changed the exclude_protected option to exclude_unscriptable.
  - Added is_task_giver in xcreature, the NPC and squad checked against the active tasks.
  - Fixed the xsquad task giver check missing dialog tasks.

1.0.3
  The version call and the MCM page
    The xlibs MCM page shows the version and a description.

  - Added version, for a dependency check, and the MCM info page.

1.0.2
  Player stashes left out
    The stash finder leaves out the stashes the player made.

  - Fixed find_stashes listing player stashes.

1.0.1
  Companion squads left out
    The squad protection check leaves companion squads alone.

  - Fixed is_protected_squad missing companion squads.

1.0.0
  The first release, 19 modules for Anomaly Lua modding
    The library wraps entity, squad, smart, level, item, stash, PDA, logging and MCM work.

  - Added xcreature, entity identification and an iterator.
  - Added xsquad, squad search, scripted control, release and iteration.
  - Added xsmart, smart terrain queries, faction, capacity, arrival and conquest.
  - Added xlevel, levels, game time and location names.
  - Added xobject, server object lookup and offline item creation.
  - Added xstash, stash search, looting and filling.
  - Added xdata, the protected NPC and squad tables.
  - Added xtable, xttltable, xmath, xstring, xinspect, xbus and xevent, the table, timing, random, string, inspection, event bus and hook helpers.
  - Added xlog, xprofiler and xtrace, buffered logging, profiling and trace ids.
  - Added xpda, PDA messages and map markers, and xmcm, the MCM config helpers.
